B.aqh=new A.o3("HOW INFORMATION MAY BE USED",B.a02,null)
B.Z2=s(["We retain account and game information while your account is active or while it is needed to provide the service. When an account-deletion request is processed, account and associated gameplay data are scheduled for removal, subject to any information we must retain for legal, security or fraud-prevention reasons."],t.s)
B.aqi=new A.o3("DATA RETENTION",B.Z2,null)
B.Xe=s(["We may update this policy when our services, features or service providers change. The revised date will be shown at the top of this page."],t.s)
