B.Yz=s(["First Guess uses Google Firebase services for features such as authentication, cloud data and server-side functions. Google and Apple sign-in may be available, depending on your platform and the options you choose.","App-store, hosting, security and diagnostic providers may process technical information when delivering these services. Their processing is also governed by their applicable privacy terms."],t.s)
